4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q4Mq8h8va0MQ7kNvwFBuwn4&_nc_oc=AdpZCzXZu6zA_HUinHGar35Wnh4C9uotUDy_Bht8FX5KQm9PJdawuppLvdglBVrrGNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG_9rJYvs-AKPAgfyfxLo3Ek31aavZCxYNH7V80ZIjR_A&oe=6A772954"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wmwNUzx6vD4Q7kNvwFnSfQb&_nc_oc=AdpxKLxRWEIrpt2jo6kJf3T6tHKJxC5LBY7j49SJTORMsta6p8q6LuZB5X3uniUqq4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQES4OKLxK6uHCnR7I3m_PzLow1Jizlfp1Vu52vAq4WSfQ&oe=6A772E32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mc4njWDgeFYQ7kNvwG0jaLV&_nc_oc=AdouauG2f0W-XcuxwzFJ1kWgBErdu-rEBC86BkjZLaQ5euKoLMBnTz1ZQRBlc_F2zEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFo9lDfb5bEuCOfsb1qpTzobY1U2YpL-Tu7vRxX0S79AQ&oe=6A773BD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p